    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Research over the past few decades has had profound implications on teaching. It is imperative that this research be brought into the classrooms of progressive universities like AKU. However, unpacking previous learning and making a paradigm shift from a content-centered approach to a learning-centered approach is difficult. This is what Re-thinking Teaching workshop is all about. It is a four day workshop for faculty to examine and develop their thinking about the course design process and their teaching practice.",
